\par\par \b \uc2  ASIA  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2  - Regionals ride firmer yen. \b0\par\par\uc2 781 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Juli 1999\par 10:49\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      0900 GMT - Asian regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  were mostly firmer on \par \par \uc2  the back of the yen's overnight leap against the dollar, though \par \par \uc2  gains were limited. \par \par \uc2      Bank of Japan \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has so far failed to \par \par \uc2  materialise, and the yen was probing below the 118.00 level in \par \par \uc2  the late afternoon after easing throughout the Asian trading \par \par \uc2  day. \par \par \uc2      Overall business was fairly light due to a public holiday \par \par \uc2  in Japan. \par \par \uc2      *** The Taiwan dollar did not benefit much from the yen's \par \par \uc2  rise, with worries about the \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2  situation offset by the fear \par \par \uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2      The bank moved in on Monday offering dollars to major local \par \par \uc2  banks outside the market. \par \par \uc2      President Lee Teng-hui, in a closely-watched address, said \par \par \uc2  that "one China" was indeed possible, but only under a \par \par \uc2  democratic union, and Taipei-Beijing interactions in the \par \par \uc2  meantime should be "on an equal basis with an equal attitude". \par \par \uc2  Taiwan has followed its massive defence of markets on \par \par \uc2  Monday with the announcement of a T$500 billion stabilisation \par \par \uc2  fund to calm rattled investors. \par \par \uc2  The government also said it will take various other \par \par \uc2  measures to support the stock market when necessary, including \par \par \uc2  adjusting credit trading ratios and supplying liquidity to \par \par \uc2  brokerages. \par \par \uc2  *** A Reuters poll of eight economists has produced an \par \par \uc2  average forecast of an 8.51 percent growth in Taiwan industrial \par \par \uc2  output in June, reflecting strong export growth. \par \par \uc2      Industrial output and export order figures for June are due \par \par \uc2  to be released at 0230 GMT on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2      *** The won was easier after dollar purchases by state-run \par \par \uc2  banks triggered strong bids from both local and offshore \par \par \uc2  players. \par \par \uc2      The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been active of late in keeping the won \par \par \uc2  in check for the sake of exports. \par \par \uc2      The finance ministry plans to resume issuing \par \par \uc2  won-denominated government bonds from next month. \par \par \uc2      A ministry official said the issues would resume after two \par \par \uc2  auctions on July 7 and July 19 had been postponed to allow for \par \par \uc2  the passing of a supplementary budget. \par \par \uc2      *** The rupiah picked up slightly but is still shy of the \par \par \uc2  6,500 level and unlikely to get there until the political \par \par \uc2  picture becomes clearer. \par \par \uc2      But Indonesian newspapers reported that the official \par \par \uc2  results of the June 7 elections would be delayed yet again, and \par \par \uc2  are now expected on July 26. \par \par \uc2      The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's new senior deputy governor Anwar \par \par \uc2  Nasution predicted interest rates and inflation would fall to \par \par \uc2  around 10 percent by the end of 1999. \par \par \uc2      Nasution said the government had revised its GDP growth \par \par \uc2  target for 1999 to around two percent, due mainly to \par \par \uc2  improvements in the farm sector and rising oil prices. \par \par \uc2      *** The Philippine peso bucked the trend and slipped \par \par \uc2  against the dollar as \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Rafael Buenaventura \par \par \uc2  affirmed his bias for lower interest rates, saying the \par \par \uc2  government would work towards "the lowest interest rate \par \par \uc2  possible". \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has cut key overnight rates 20 times this \par \par \uc2  year for a total easing of 437.5 basis points, but had kept \par \par \uc2  rates steady over the past two weeks because of a volatile \par \par \uc2  peso. \par \par \uc2  Separately, the government is predicting second-quarter GDP \par \par \uc2  growth of 2.0 percent from the same period last year, due \par \par \uc2  largely to a rebound in the agricultural sector. \par \par \uc2      Second-quarter figures are scheduled to be released by the \par \par \uc2  end of next month. \par \par \uc2      *** The Sing dollar rode the yen's coat-tails higher. \par \par \uc2      The government projected total trade growth of four to six \par \par \uc2  percent in 1999, revised up from a previous projected decline \par \par \uc2  of five to seven percent. \par \par \uc2      The Trade Development Board said the better performance was \par \par \uc2  underpinned by a rebound in global electronics demand and a \par \par \uc2  bottoming-out of crisis-hit economies in Asia. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCIES\b0 \highlight\uc2  VS U.S. DOLLAR \par \par \uc2  Change on the day TUE 20 0831GMT \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ...Latest bid....Prev Close....Pct Move \par \par \uc2   Ringgit......3.7995.......3.8000.........0.01% \par \par \uc2   Rupiah......6690.00......6700.00.........0.15% \par \par \uc2   Baht..........37.10........37.19.........0.24% \par \par \uc2   Peso..........38.36........38.32........-0.10% \par \par \uc2   Sing dlr.....1.6960.......1.7038.........0.46% \par \par \uc2   Taiwan dlr...32.235.......32.330.........0.29% \par