\par\par \b \uc2  ASIA  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2  - Regionals mixed, Taiwan in hotseat. \b0\par\par\uc2 741 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Juli 1999\par 03:44\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      0130 - Asian regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  were mixed in early deals \par \par \uc2  with the yen holding on to overnight gains. \par \par \uc2      The dollar fell to a four-week low of 120.36 yen in New \par \par \uc2  York, but dealers said it was likely to be supported by fears \par \par \uc2  of yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of Japan. \par \par \uc2      They said the dollar was likely to be on the defensive due \par \par \uc2  to increasing optimism about a recovery in Japan, the possible \par \par \uc2  emergence of inflationary pressures in the United States and \par \par \uc2  jitters over Latin America. \par \par \uc2  *** The Taiwan dollar is likely to come under further \par \par \uc2  pressure after being propped up on Wednesday by \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  amid growing jitters over frictions with \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Dealers said inflows of foreign equity funds should provide \par \par \uc2  some support to the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but this would be countered by \par \par \uc2  players covering short U.S. dollar positions. \par \par \uc2  Taiwan stocks slid 3.85 percent on Wednesday, closing below \par \par \uc2  the key 8,000 level after Tuesday's 3.06 percent decline. The \par \par \uc2  weighted index was down 1.70 percent in early Thursday trade. \par \par \uc2  In a sign of escalating tension, China's defence minister \par \par \uc2  cautioned Taiwan on Wednesday against declaring independence in \par \par \uc2  the strongest warning to the island since its surprise move to \par \par \uc2  abandon its "one-China" policy. \par \par \uc2  "The Chinese People's Liberation Army is ready at any time \par \par \uc2  to safeguard the territorial integrity of China and smash any \par \par \uc2  attempts to separate the country," the official Xinhua news \par \par \uc2  agency quoted Minister Chi Haotian as saying. \par \par \uc2  *** The rupiah was drooping a bit in thin trade as the \par \par \uc2  market absorbed further falls in local interest rates, while \par \par \uc2  keeping an eye on the political scene. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia's weekly auction of one-month SBI \par \par \uc2  certificates resulted in a weighted average interest rate of \par \par \uc2  15.86 percent against 17.15 percent last week. \par \par \uc2  Tentative results from the June parliamentary elections are \par \par \uc2  due to be released on Thursday evening. The results will then \par \par \uc2  have to be verified by the General Election Commission and the \par \par \uc2  final results are due next Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  *** The Korean won was a bit weaker, but traders expected \par \par \uc2  it to be sandwiched in a range between exporter dollar sales \par \par \uc2  and dollar demand from local banks preparing to meet a \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2  exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  loan loss provision deadline. \par \par \uc2  Finance Minister Kang Bong-kyun said concerns that the \par \par \uc2  economy was becoming overheated were groundless, given last \par \par \uc2  year's 5.8 percent contraction. \par \par \uc2  Kang said there would be no major price increases this \par \par \uc2  year. The annual inflation rate is forecast to reach about two \par \par \uc2  percent this year, following a 7.5 percent rise in 1998. \par \par \uc2  Korean bond yields have been rising recently as the market \par \par \uc2  frets about an interest rate hike, but the government has said \par \par \uc2  it does not plan to raise the overnight rate this month. \par \par \uc2  Commenting on the share market's downturn this week after a \par \par \uc2  remarkable bull run this year, Kang said the market was moving \par \par \uc2  according to market principles. \par \par \uc2  *** The Philippines posted a $509 million trade surplus in \par \par \uc2  the first five months of this year, against a $1.6 billion \par \par \uc2  deficit the year before. In May, the surplus was $214 million, \par \par \uc2  against a $251 million deficit in April and a $209 million \par \par \uc2  deficit last May. \par \par \uc2  May exports were up 13.7 percent on the year and up 17.1 \par \par \uc2  percent from April. Imports slipped 3.5 percent on the year and \par \par \uc2  2.5 percent from April. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCIES\b0 \highlight\uc2  VS U.S. DOLLAR \par \par \uc2   Change on the day THU 15 0131GMT \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ...Latest bid....Prev Close....Pct Move \par \par \uc2   Ringgit......3.7998.......3.8000..........0.01% \par \par \uc2   Rupiah......6755.00......6675.00.........-1.18% \par \par \uc2   Baht..........37.08........37.07.........-0.03% \par \par \uc2   Peso..........38.12........38.20..........0.21% \par \par \uc2   Sing dlr.....1.6988.......1.6985.........-0.02% \par \par \uc2   Taiwan dlr...32.220.......32.280..........0.19% \par \par \uc2   Korean won..1185.50......1183.00.........-0.21% \par \par \uc2   Japan yen....120.50.......121.13..........0.52% \par \par \uc2   Change since start of Asia crisis \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .....Latest......July '97......Pct Move \par \par \uc2   Ringgit......3.7998.......2.5200........-33.68% \par \par \uc2   Rupiah......6755.00......2432.00........-64.00% \par \par \uc2   Baht..........37.08........25.90........-30.15% \par \par \uc2   Peso..........38.12........26.50........-30.48% \par \par \uc2   Sing dlr.....1.6988.......1.4300........