\par\par \b \uc2  Chinese Yuan Ends -3: Trade Inflows Support Yuan \b0\par\par\uc2 245 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Januar 1999\par 04:59\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Traders said strong trade inflows are likely to keep the yuan steady in 1999. \par \par \uc2  China posted a $43 billion trade surplus in 1998. And though exports have been dogged by the Asian financial crisis, the surplus has been maintained by an even faster slide in China's imports. \par \par \uc2  Other market fundamentals also supporting the yuan, traders said. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which controls all hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  exchange in China, holds about $145 billion in reserves. That war chest is more than ample to balance any shifts in the official exchange, which averages less than $150 million in daily trading volume. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  also watches trade closely, and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly to prevent sharp fluctuations. The constant market monitoring has forced the yuan into an extremely tight trading range for the past two years. \par \par \uc2  In other trading Friday, the Hong Kong dollar closed at CNY1.0675 from CNY1.0678, while the Japanese yen closed at CNY7.1150 per Y100 from CNY7.1698 on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  In the non-deliverable forward market, money broker Exco Group in Singapore was quoting the U.S. dollar at CNY8.6078 for delivery in six months and at CNY8.9778 over a one-year timeframe. The six-month rate now carries a premium of CNY0.33, and the one-year rate a premium of CNY0.90. \par \par \uc2  -By Joshua Cherin; (8621)6218-3268; jcherin@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 29-01-99 \par \par \uc2  0359GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv1t00p2g\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
