ight\uc2 , Taiwan's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  periodically to smooth the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's progress. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 14-12-98 \par \par \uc2  0924GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917duce0237d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
