\par\par \b \uc2  ASIA  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2  - Regionals head further south. \b0\par\par\uc2 552 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 August 1998\par 06:57\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  0450 GMT - Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  remained weak as the yen struggled to make headway and traders focused on a host of worrying factors, including worries about the Chinese yuan and the econo would also mean higher costs for imported raw materials and inflation. \par \par \uc2  The deputy \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Liu Mingkang said the bank would take necessary steps to maintain the yuan's stability and advised \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  speculators "not to miscalculate". \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2 's tightly controlled \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Monday, its third such move in a little over a week. \par \par \uc2  The yuan closed slightly higher on Tuesday, buoyed by news of a 6.9 percent yearly rise in exports for the first seven months. \par \par \uc2  *** The Philippine peso was weak but crept back the right side of the 44 per dollar level as banks took profit on their dollar purchases. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's move to raise key overnight rates by two percentage points was insufficient to stem the peso's decline, and actual \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market might be required. \par \par \uc2  Bankness and a gloomy domestic economic outlook were also weighing against the Sing dollar, with dollar/Sing moving virtually in lock-step with dollar/yen recently. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Singapore said second quarter \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading volumes were up from the previous quarter, but sharply down from a year agook Tong. \par \par \uc2  Singapore's GDP rose 8.5 percent in the second quarter of 1997. The ministry also announced that the Q2 CPI rose just 0.3 percent on a year-on-year basis. \par \par \uc2  *** The Indian rupee was weak in early deals due to dollar demand from local banks as Indian stock markets headed south with the region and traders worried about domestic political uncertainties. \par \par \uc2  The ruling minority coalition government in India faces threats of withdrawal of support from two key allies, with both parties toughening their stance this week. \par \par \uc2  *** The Korean won was firmer, against the general trend, as export deals outweighed dollar demand from importers. \par \par \uc2  But La Nina, which is being blamed for the unusually wet weather along sections of the Pacific Rim, continues to take its toll and make the regions economic crisis even worse. \par \par \uc2  Seoul and the most northern regions of South Korea are expected to get up to six Property losses because of the floods are seen reaching two trillion won or around $1.5 billion and the agriculture ministry said 10 percent of the crop on the flooded 100,000 acres of rice fields could be lost. \par \par \uc2  A \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official said GDP could contract even more than the four percent projected by the government and IMF. \par \par \uc2  *** The ringgit has been stuck in a downtrend channel since late March and with the government's new policy of interest rate reductions to stimulate the economy, it can only weaken further. \par \par \uc2  Bank Negara cut its key three-month \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate by 50 basis points to 10 percent on Monday, its second cut in a week. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said the latest cut was in response to excess liquidity in the banking system, which had pushed down domestic interbank rates in recent days. \par \par \uc2  Some dealers said the new cut was designed to help compensate for the large reduction in banks' base lending rates recently. \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021113du8b02ukk\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
